# Conformance probe pack for `absent` under `bit_order msb-lsb` (spec 0.22,
# ruling 2: the raw value a sentinel compares is read in the pack's bit
# order). Public. No kinds. Bit order msb-lsb (spec 0.22): positions count from the
# high bit of each byte, a value is assembled from its first bit up.
#
#   byte 0        x      raw value 1 (wire 80) means absent
format     conformance-long-mlsb-absent
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  msb-lsb
field   probe.x  0:0:8  uint  absent 1
